<title>USA: TABLE - Hutchinson Technology Q3 June 29.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hutchinson Technology Q3 June 29.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter Ended</p>
<p>					     Jun 29, 1997  Jun 23, 1996</p>
<p> Net sales				   $121,713,000$ 91,418,000</p>
<p> Gross profit				  33,179,000  21,786,000</p>
<p> Income from operations		    16,553,000   6,878,000</p>
<p> Net income				    13,698,000   5,199,000</p>
<p> Net income per share				0.68	  0.31</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		   20,276,000  16,818,000</p>
<p>		  Nine Months</p>
<p> Net sales				  $352,878,000 $261,296,000</p>
<p> Gross profit				102,971,000   61,109,000</p>
<p> Income from operations		   52,893,000   16,298,000</p>
<p> Net income				   41,498,000   12,393,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			     2.24	   0.74</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		  18,526,000   16,815,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Hutchinson Technology Corp.</p>
<p>Earnings adjusted for three-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 results include $0.23 a share charge for fixed commitments to International Business Machines Corp under technology-sharing agreement.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
